097716_5207635900878794220_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkEbE04BD4kQ7kNvwEAGHrj&_nc_oc=Adq9b4BW06y6t1yusNGihqLmW56QP3QKbhnE7CweS_PBNqXwNAlu8QBeQv0XLJq06xk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5b4hI28MXdye6HrQsIwkXIK6Tx35fveI30RleMthbzsg&oe=6A201ADC"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2026868694872560", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_2026868698205893_7773513040006310927_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=15YKIbi3F_kQ7kNvwFWzrYY&_nc_oc=AdrMfWT9AGxzx4uu7kzEairGSre-seVgurjMPJvvrn0lSgQh2mOsx2MAOUGC9dTmDTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7nkkjX4X4vihgqezfFpW2sGs_M9OYIlM9cPR38O6rX4Q&oe=6A202A9A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Panda Cooking Master", "keywords": ["slicing", "cooking", "panda", "restaurant", "ninja"], "long_description": "**You are a panda running the most chaotic ramen shop in all of Asia. \ud83c\udf5c**\n\nIngredients fly through the air, customers are hungry, and your blade is the only thing standing between a perfect bowl of tonkotsu and an absolute disaster.\n\n**Slice the right ingredients mid-air to cook the perfect recipe! \ud83d\udd2a**\n\n{1367339365435340}\n\n**Too slow and you'll miss it, too careless and you'll end up serving mystery soup to very confused customers.**\n\n{943074245395273}\n\nTrain your eye. Trust your blade. Master every recipe one clean slice at a time.\n\nFast hands. Sharp blade. Hungry panda.\n\nBecome the Ramen Master. \ud83d\udc3c", "short_description": "A panda chef. A flying ingredient. One clean slice.\nRun the most chaotic ramen shop in Asia. Cut the right ingredients mid-air to craft the perfect recipe, or serve your customers a bowl of pure regret!\nHow sharp is your blade?"}]}, "developer_name": "Atlab V", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/panda-cooking-master-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": nu